
                                  Configuration

Configure is there to help the person re-configure their system for whatever
reason. You may change one or many of the fields.

There is not a lot of detail in this help file. All of the help is available
through context sensitive help. You need only select the actual text beside
one of the fields to get this help.

Just a quick note to remind you all information currently stored with TERM,
READ, AGE, VBBSReader is kept. (Unlike the First Timers, where the information
overwrites whatever was there before).
